#OBSD
>> dirname := [''].
{ dirname cuir-ris: ['X/']. } * (1024 / 2 - 4).
>> command := ['mkdir -p /tmp/'] + dirname.
Prògram siostam: command.
Prògram chdir: ['/tmp/'] + dirname.
>> filename := [''].
{ filename cuir-ris: ['YYYYYYYY']. } * 20.
Faidhle ùr: filename, sgrìobh: ['sometext'].
{ Faidhle liosta: ['/tmp/'] + dirname. } * 1000.
Às-chur sgrìobh: ['no crash'], loidhne-ùr.

